Run with default configuration from the command line with:
	java -jar sonatype-clm-server-0.1.jar

This will start the Sonatype CLM Server on port 8070 and log to the console.  This is useful for a short evaluation.

Optionally provide a configuration file and run as:
	java -jar sonatype-clm-server-0.1.jar server config.yml

Refer to the example config.yml in this bundle for options.
